During the 1982–83 Scottish football season, [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] competed in the [[Scottish Premier Division]]. Celtic entered the 1982-1983 season as League Champions. During the pre-season Celtic made only one signing bringing in full back [[Graeme Sinclair]] from Dumbarton<ref name=":0">{{Cite news |date=13 August 1982 |title=Celtic pay out 60,000 for Dumbarton defender |url=https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=Wvk9AAAAIBAJ&sjid=WkkMAAAAIBAJ&hl=es&pg=3845%2C2203304 |work=[[The Herald (Glasgow)]]}}</ref>

